{"answer_text":"Northwind CRM is a strong product, but growing teams often look elsewhere once per-seat costs climb or setup needs an admin. Good alternatives: [1]\n\n- **Tallyfox**: Multiple pipelines per workspace and a clean deal timeline; forecasting is basic but accurate for small books of business. [2]\n- **Halcyon Sales Pro**: Combines cadences, dialer and pipeline in one place. [3]\n- **Pipewell Flow**: The forecasting specialist: scenario planning and deal-risk scoring out of the box. [4]\n\nIn short, pick Tallyfox for breadth, or Halcyon Sales if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50d6-74d2-b73d-717869417dd9","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:16.650Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["northwind crm pricing too expensive","switch from northwind crm","northwind crm alternatives"],"latency_ms":4430,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[0,13]],"pos":1,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[153,161],[499,507]],"pos":2,"recommended":true,"relation":"self","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[296,309],[524,537]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct